      "type": "place",
      "authority": "unlocode",
      "to": "place",
      "example": "USNOL"
    },
    {
      "id": "month",
      "name": "Delivery month",
      "type": "period",
      "clock": "UTC",
      "day_start": 0,
      "grains": [
        "month"
      ],
      "to": "period",
      "example": "2027-03"
    }
  ],
  "note": "A grade as its standard or exchange rulebook defines it, delivered at a place named by UN/LOCODE in a month (UTC); the amount in the grade's own unit of trade (bushels, pounds, short tons, or tonnes in kg). Sources: https://www.cmegroup.com/notices/ser/2016/11/SER-7800R.pdf"
}
